        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCBUR19, Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob with Arched Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Plate has a classic style due to the pairing of the scalloped egg shaped crystal knob and the steep arched tall plate. Together, they make a knobset that is grand enough to stand up to big doors and even bigger rooms. The Arc Plate is 11 inches tall and 2-1/2 inches wide, making it truly a stunning statement piece. Made by Grandeur Hardware, the Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob with Arched Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The rosette is available in a wide array of finish colors, all of which really help the Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob stand out.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/arc-tall-plate-entrance-set-with-burgundy-crystal-knob-grandeur-arcbur19entr\"><b>Arc Tall Plate Entrance Set with Burgundy Crystal Knob</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Crystal Egg Shaped Burgundy Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Clear Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCBUR19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCBUR19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Plate",
                "description": "The Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Plate has a classic style due to the pairing of the scalloped egg shaped crystal knob and the steep arched tall plate. Together, they make a knobset that is grand enough to stand up to big doors and even bigger rooms. The Arc Plate is 11 inches tall and 2-1/2 inches wide, making it truly a stunning statement piece. Made by Grandeur Hardware, the Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob with Arched Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The rosette is available in a wide array of finish colors, all of which really help the Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob stand out.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Plates, Crystal Burgundy Knob with Arc Tall Plates, Grandeur ARCBUR19 single dummy Knobs, Grandeur ARCBUR24 double dummy Knobs, Grandeur ARCBUR12 passage Knobs, Grandeur ARCBUR42 privacy Knobs, GRA-ARCBUR19, Clear Crystal Burgundy Knob with Arched Plates, Grandeur Crystal Egg Shaped Burgundy Knob with Arched Roses, Clear Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arched Plates, glass knobs, Grandeur ARCBUR82 keyed entry Knobs,"
